==Battleground==
*1 [[Ritual Drum Doge]] spawns as the boss.
*1 [[Festival Sign Girl]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*9 [[Croco]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*9 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Festive Otter]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Vendor El]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Use any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

